  "html": "<h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>设计模板下载及导出指南</strong></span></h1><p><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>【更新时间】：2026年10月16日</strong></span></p><h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>1、设计模板下载</strong></span></h1><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><a href=\"dop/static/theme/template/主题商店设计模板.sketch\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(66, 144, 247); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">主题商店设计模板下载（sketch格式）</span></a></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><a href=\"dop/static/theme/template/主题商店设计模板.pix\" target=\"_blank\"><span style=\"color: rgb(66, 144, 247); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">主题商店设计模板下载（pix格式）</span></a></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>注：主题商店设计模板供有需要的设计师下载使用，可配合主题编辑器使用。</strong></span></p><h1 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(38, 38, 38); font-size: 22px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2、主题模板导出指南</strong></span></h1><h3 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.1打开设计模板</strong></span></h3><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>第一步：</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设计模板使用pixso打开，官方网站 https://pixso.cn/，打开网站注册账号</span></h4><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>第二步：</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">注册完成后，点击右上角【进入工作台】</span></h4><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/415f837cd7ea44db8aa9082ffbfb554a.jpg?auth_key=1795677198-52b8b6dd45d446e6abababed2c7fdd85-0-433e89ecd0c8e50e1af84a0f478d58c552cceacf10dab21ee2e137703013c5a0\" alt=\"2jpg.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1078.89px;height: 367.48px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">图2-1 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设计指引示例1</span></p><h4 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>第三步：</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">进入工作台后，点击</span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>导入文件</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，将Pixso设计模板导入到我的文档</span></h4><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/0ca2ba12efd64b7f9ad5185209c065b5.jpg?auth_key=1795677198-65553d7220434c778f085faa7a15772b-0-876f82803e0b66a65425b5c156e2badfbc1dd80023921ad08dc1e2a821c063c9\" alt=\"3jpg.jpg\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1086.99px;height: 481.76px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">图2-2 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设计指引示例2</span></p><h3 style=\"text-align: left; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.2壁纸设计模板</strong></span></h3><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.2.1文档结构</strong></span></h4><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">本文件结构如下：</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>【1壁纸】</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">壁纸全量集，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>底层文件</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，文件内其余所有效果图都链接此画板内壁纸；</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>【2图标】</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">图标全量集，</span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>底层文件</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，文件内其余所有效果图都链接此画板内图标；</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>【3切图】</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"> 用于输出切图资源包；</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/17fbfbdc3d034b638881950c9f8cfa97.png?auth_key=1795677198-49b8d0a753e34e058fecfe7a03f265f4-0-61910bf2a369ce5372d80d2e09ac6077dbcc66b34139286170d5a7fc0f0d9234\" alt=\"2.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1027.27px;height: 487.10px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">图2-3 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设计模板示例</span></p><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.2.2壁纸</strong></span></h4><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">选中【壁纸】页面，文件结构：</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【壁纸】页面右侧为</span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>壁纸底层文件</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，将设计好的壁纸导入对应的画板内，效果图、切图等页面都调用此画板内的壁纸资源。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【壁纸】页面左侧为</span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>效果图</strong></span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，查看壁纸在车机上的效果。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/180ea891031d4555a46b034a89fbd44e.png?auth_key=1795677198-fd454f5a6b914ac78d12921fc4a2990f-0-96a95464afa524cf8b16d5aee1afd2ce682c0dea3fece5a5d90ef1c71d81bde6\" alt=\"4.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 995.30px;height: 458.18px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">图2-4 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设计模板壁纸示例1</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.2.3图标</strong></span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">选中【图标】页面，文件结构：</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【图标】页面右侧为</span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>图标清单</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，按照清单设计图标。</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">【图标】页面左侧为</span><span style=\"color: rgb(225, 60, 57); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>效果图</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">，查看图标在车机上的效果。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/cbcce11b6f6f45dea12f160d7b1902ef.png?auth_key=1795677198-b10275c19d71498999ea092de894711a-0-bd241985ae75f2cb0b30e32292fddbe525b6699995a6146cbc113bbf3683d9eb\" alt=\"3.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 970.30px;height: 460.42px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">图2-5 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设计模板图标示例</span></p><h4 style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>2.2.4静态资源输出</strong></span></h4><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>第一步：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">选中【3切图】。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/c9b47449f7aa4f9daafa70f35d5b0597.png?auth_key=1795677198-46aea3c78e5e4c1c955af43f9c11c996-0-a70592fe5aa5693c08c20d4098fd43aca9b83f33b80880ced3da096c6ff587ef\" alt=\"企业微信截图_17921418202291.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 1079.32px;height: 501.95px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">图2-6 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设计模板资源包输出示例1</span></p><p style=\"line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>第二步：</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">点击右上角研发模式开关；选中【切图】菜单；【查看当前页面所有切图】；一键导出，</span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\"><strong>导出的zip包</strong></span><span style=\"font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">内含静态壁纸、图标、静态预览图，图标可打包zip上传到主题编辑器。</span></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><img src=\"https://openplatform-cdn.byd.com/dop/document-admin/document/4ca4a74fc63a4b548b9262e721b3dd98.png?auth_key=1795677198-e4863c8d03d1461da02a1a20dd15d4cf-0-20efd859210f2f6bde8f098359284462b4c00c3c84569b38ad720e4f743a3376\" alt=\"8.png\" data-href=\"\" width=\"\" height=\"\" style=\"width: 966.99px;height: 673.09px;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: center; line-height: 1.75;\"><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px;\">图2-7 </span><span style=\"color: rgb(89, 89, 89); font-size: 16px; font-family: 微软雅黑;\">设计模板资源包输出示例2</span></p>"
}
